es attaches.\\ndocs/design/dao.stream.md:316:For the time being, the operative guarantee is the round trip: `descriptor`\\ndocs/design/dao.stream.md:317:on a live handle returns `:dao.stream/ok` with `:dao.stream/descriptor`,\\ndocs/design/dao.stream.md:319:`:dao.stream/identity`, equal through every handle and descriptor for the\\ndocs/design/dao.stream.md:346:| `:dao.stream/invalid-descriptor` | The descriptor is malformed.                                                        | —                    |\\ndocs/design/dao.stream.md:347:| `:dao.stream/not-found`          | The descriptor names no stream here, or no transport matches its type.              | —                    |\\ndocs/design/dao.stream.md:375:When a creation specification or portable descriptor arrives dynamically —\\ndocs/design/dao.stream.md:416:`descriptor` belongs to no surface: every handle answers it with both\\ndocs/design/dao.stream.md:557:  it is given is on a different logical stream, never a defect. A descriptor\\ndocs/design/dao.stream.md:560:- A cursor carries the logical-stream identity, not a reachability descriptor.\\ndocs/design/dao.stream.md:562:  descriptors for the same logical stream accept the same cursor.\\ndocs/design/dao.stream.md:646:stream persists, its descriptor remains valid, and `attach!` may rejoin\\ndocs/design/dao.stream.md:653:closes, the handle's `append!` answers `closed`; `descriptor` still answers\\ndocs/design/dao.stream.md:883:   the result map may carry, under a transport-owned key, a descriptor or\\ndocs/design/dao.stream.md:890:   `transport-error` otherwise; `descriptor` still answers `ok`, because a name\\ndocs/design/dao.stream.md:1013:  one and no chunked element. Large media travel as content addresses in the\\n\",\"exit_code\":0,\"status\":\"completed\"}}\ncollab/dao-space/1794057158000-architect-byte-cut-second-review-gpt6astra.gpt-6-astra.stdout.log:40:{\"type\":\"item.started\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"item_20\",\"type\":\"command_execution\",\"command